.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt OMP-GATEWAY-CTL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm omp-gateway-ctl
.Nd manage the local loopback Oh-My-Pi multi-account broker and OpenAI gateway
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar options ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
manages the local loopback Oh-My-Pi
.Pq Nm omp
credential broker on
.Ql 127.0.0.1:11509
and OpenAI-compatible multi-account model gateway on
.Ql 127.0.0.1:11510 .
It enforces profile isolation between
.Ql ZDOTS_CONTEXT=work
and personal Home environments.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "import-keychain"
.It Cm status Op Fl -json
Report loopback broker and gateway status.
.It Cm start
Start the loopback broker and OpenAI-compatible gateway daemons.
.It Cm stop
Stop the loopback broker and gateway daemons.
.It Cm restart
Restart the loopback broker and gateway daemons.
.It Cm login Op Ar provider
Authenticate a provider account in the active profile broker.
.It Cm import-keychain
Import API keys from macOS Keychain into the Home profile broker.
Refused when
.Ql ZDOTS_CONTEXT=work .
.It Cm check Op Fl -strict
Probe configured credentials across accounts.
.It Cm accounts
Display usage and rate-limit status across authenticated accounts.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr llama-ctl 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 1
